The file internal/identitymodel/model.json is the browser-identity network of
that project (packages/header-generator/src/data_files/input-network-definition.zip),
converted by cmd/identity-model-import into this repository's own JSON format.
The probabilities are unchanged; the structure of the file, the ordering of
entries and the numbering of values are new. The sampling rules in
internal/identitymodel follow the project's generative-bayesian-network package
and are reimplemented in Go. The upstream commit, its date and the SHA-256 of
the imported file are recorded in the model file's "source" field.
